 "text": "Smuggler's radioed orders in secret code. Elizabeth Friedman read them anyway. How without the key? Their code swapped each letter the same way every time, so patterns showed. She and an aide cracked over 12 ,000 messages. Nazi spies used enigma, which changed the swap every key press. Her team still broke it. Lesson patterns that repeat leaked secrets never reuse a password. Download RM to support livelihood tools."
